      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "亡者どもが嫌がる香を放つ香木があれば\nこの神殿で魔除けの護符を作ることができる。\n希少なものではあるが……ビャクダンの香木を\n手に入れてきてもらえぬだろうか。",
        "official_en": "To craft evil-repelling amulets, my temple needs a\nspecial wood with a fragrance the risen dead find\nrepulsive. It's difficult to come by, but if you could,\nplease find some sandalwood.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
